□ STRONG BULLISH (7+ bullish signals, 0-2 bearish)
    → Leverage: 2.5-3.0x | LONG bias | Trade size: FULL
    
□ BULLISH (5-6 bullish signals, 2-3 bearish)
    → Leverage: 2.0x | LONG bias | Trade size: 75%
    
□ NEUTRAL (3-4 bullish, 3-4 bearish, OR mixed signals)
    → Leverage: 1.0x | Bi-directional | Trade size: 50%
    
□ BEARISH (2-3 bullish signals, 5-6 bearish)
    → Leverage: 2.0x | SHORT bias | Trade size: 75%
    
□ STRONG BEARISH (0-2 bullish signals, 7+ bearish)
    → Leverage: 2.5-3.0x | SHORT bias | Trade size: FULL

RISK ASSESSMENT:
□ CRITICAL (3+ warning signals) → Reduce all leverage 50%, consider pause
□ HIGH (2 warning signals) → Reduce leverage 25%
□ NORMAL (0-1 warning signals) → Proceed as normal
```

